{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0An auto-battle strategy game featuring the heroes of &quot;CrusadersQuest&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own deck with a variety of heroes to defeat enemies and rescue the goddesses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Crusaders Quest\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/4e67906c36af0539c456639a71189513.poster.avif?t=1759116016\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/4e67906c36af0539c456639a71189513.webm?t=1759116016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/4e67906c36af0539c456639a71189513.mp4?t=1759116016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beloved universe of Crusaders Quest, cherished for its signature pixel art, returns in a reimagined adventure!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Follow the tales of Heroes and Goddesses on a journey that feels both familiar and refreshingly new.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience our strategic combat system where matching blocks unleashes powerful\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 heroes, delivering both satisfying, fast-paced action and deep tactical fun.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Merge\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/f30cfcc64a1ccaa9baa71eb9c34344f0.poster.avif?t=1759116016\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/f30cfcc64a1ccaa9baa71eb9c34344f0.webm?t=1759116016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/f30cfcc64a1ccaa9baa71eb9c34344f0.mp4?t=1759116016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consecutive collection of identical blocks increases the chance of obtaining a\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 higher-grade hero.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Heroes of the same grade to upgrade them to a higher-grade hero.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various rewards and the fun of exploring the world await.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Chess\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/d17dcaa37d48ff2838fef65399d68901.poster.avif?t=1759116016\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/d17dcaa37d48ff2838fef65399d68901.webm?t=1759116016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/d17dcaa37d48ff2838fef65399d68901.mp4?t=1759116016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a battle of wits by building your deck to counter your opponent's matchups\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 and skill effects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access helpful data on Hero contributions to aid your deck building. Create your very own unique Hero deck.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergy between your Heroes and the Goddesses is crucial in combat.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Strategy\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/044f59f589e48cf9c121e4dc66cd015a.poster.avif?t=1759116016\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/044f59f589e48cf9c121e4dc66cd015a.webm?t=1759116016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/044f59f589e48cf9c121e4dc66cd015a.mp4?t=1759116016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty dynamically changes with every choice you make as you progress through the stages.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather information and fill your Codex to see the traits between Heroes and Goddesses, then use this knowledge to develop your own strategies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize events and shops offering a variety of effects to turn battles in your favor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Just a Nibble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001790/a22493e21f81ba0c5c7abd09ed1a314d1bf8b7fd.jpg"},{"name":"The Full Course","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001790/df3c7406287a72453808625f53b840ab80b1327d.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001790?t=1759116016","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001790?t=1759116016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/7e84f4c4a0096ab5964f08f23b5fb5a29a76eef1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759116016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.s