ing both satisfying, fast-paced action and deep tactical fun.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Merge\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/f30cfcc64a1ccaa9baa71eb9c34344f0.poster.avif?t=1759116016\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/f30cfcc64a1ccaa9baa71eb9c34344f0.webm?t=1759116016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/f30cfcc64a1ccaa9baa71eb9c34344f0.mp4?t=1759116016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consecutive collection of identical blocks increases the chance of obtaining a\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 higher-grade hero.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Heroes of the same grade to upgrade them to a higher-grade hero.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various rewards and the fun of exploring the world await.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Chess\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/d17dcaa37d48ff2838fef65399d68901.poster.avif?t=1759116016\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/d17dcaa37d48ff2838fef65399d68901.webm?t=1759116016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001790/extras/d17dcaa37d48ff2838fef65399d68901.mp4?t=1759116016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p 